*** FUNDING & MINIMUM DEPOSITS ***
To begin provisioning orders, you will need to fund your Main Wallet. ProxySock operates on a prepaid balance system.
- Minimum Deposit: <%= number_to_currency(@user.min_deposit_amount) %> USD
- Payment Methods: Cryptocurrency (BTC, ETH, USDT, LTC, etc.) via Plisio/Heleket, and Credit Cards via Paystack. Top up directly from your Reseller Dashboard under "Wallet & Billing".

*** TERMS OF SERVICE ***
By using your ProxySock Reseller account, you agree to our comprehensive Terms of Service:
- Zero Tolerance for Abuse: Our proxies and servers strictly prohibit illegal activities, hacking, spamming, and network abuse.
- KYC / AML: We reserve the right to request identity verification for large transactions or suspicious activity.
- Refund Policy: Wallet top-ups are non-refundable once used to purchase services.

If you have any questions or require assistance setting up your integration, our support team is available 24/7 via the ticketing system in your dashboard.

